        "stop_reason": "Original holding-weight hypothesis falsified by its own pilot outcomes (both higher-weight points fail the holding-speed acceptance that the hypothesis targeted while position/terminal pass); the two points merely replicate known matched failures; the frozen perturbation-robustness question has no legal executable route in this context; and an already-accepted incumbent exists, so further nominal-only evidence has little value. Voluntary model STOP.",
